{
  "text": [
    "We integrate our prefetcher in the PULP platform  , a ULP multicore targeting energy-efficient computation for the IoT applications.",
    "As shown in Fig. 1(a) , each processing cluster in PULP includes a set of light-weight RISC-V based cores with four pipeline stages and in-order execution (no branch prediction, predication, or multiple issue is supported) for energy efficient operation.",
    "The processors share a scratchpad memory (SPM) for computation and a DMA engine for bulk transfers."
  ],
